Expected output: `Hello friend, 2026` then `21`.

```dart
// bug: UI never rebuilds
onPressed: () { count++; }
// fix
onPressed: () => setState(() { count++; }),
```
The same bug appears when you call `items.add(x)` on a list that the UI shows.

```dart
class Cart extends ChangeNotifier {
  final _items = <String>[];
  List<String> get items => List.unmodifiable(_items);
  void add(String s) { _items.add(s); notifyListeners(); }
}
// in a widget:
ListenableBuilder(
  listenable: cart,
  builder: (context, _) => Text('${cart.items.length}'),
)
```
The unmodifiable view stops widgets mutating the list without notifying.

